{"unit_id":"gengwg__dsh-agent-router#card-zh","repo":"gengwg/dsh-agent-router","commit":"a8a9320d0dd2fd864cfcb35a2e80389725b7b98d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-router 是 DSH 子 agent 模型路由插件。它包装 subagents.startActivation，在创建子 agent 时按委派标签和提示词中的关键词选择 provider 与 model。规则按配置顺序匹配，首个命中项生效；可选设置 reasoningEffort，或允许规则覆盖调用方指定的路由。未命中时委派保持原样，空规则不改变行为。插件保留其他 agentOptions，并跳过不支持这些选项的 provider。适合希望按任务类型为子 agent 分配模型的用户，需配置关键词及 DSH 已允许的 provider 和 model。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:23-43","src/policy.js:34-72","src/config.js:53-80"]}
{"unit_id":"gengwg__dsh-agent-router#card-en","repo":"gengwg/dsh-agent-router","commit":"a8a9320d0dd2fd864cfcb35a2e80389725b7b98d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-agent-router routes DSH subagents by matching keywords in a delegation label or prompt. The first rule sets the child’s provider and model; it can preserve or override a caller’s explicit route. Unmatched tasks pass through unchanged. Configure keywords and DSH-allowed routes.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:17-43","src/policy.js:34-72","src/config.js:53-80"]}
